    "detailed_description": "<h1>Sign-Up for Playtests &amp; Exclusive VIP Content (Link in the Sidebar)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/051ddbe81e9d0df11b888ebcaa40ab1c.avif?t=1750924996\" width=800 height=199 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/9bd63aa12bf57f2617bdeb7c36747b1e.poster.webp?t=1750924996\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/9bd63aa12bf57f2617bdeb7c36747b1e.webp?t=1750924996\" class=\"bb_img\" width=601 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever felt wonder gazing at a \u26c5 <strong>cloudy sky</strong>, or that cozy feeling watching a \u26c8\ufe0f <strong>storm</strong> from inside? These sensations inspired <i><strong>Cloudscrapers</strong></i>. The game is perfect for anyone who enjoys thoughtful gameplay without a large time commitment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with basic tools and construct the <strong>highest</strong>\u00a0<strong>tower</strong> possible. Each attempt takes around 15-30 minutes and helps you unlock <strong>upgrades</strong> to build even higher. Discover ancient mysteries hidden in the clouds - though some might be better left untouched.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>bite-sized strategy experience</strong>\u00a0- perfect for short gaming sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick-up-and-play simplicity</strong> with a pleasant amount of depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No complex menus or systems</strong>\u00a0- just intuitive building mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful progression</strong> with rewards that matter - no grinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric visuals</strong> and a <strong>mysterious narrative</strong> that unfolds as you reach new heights</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/9bd63aa12bf57f2617bdeb7c36747b1e.poster.webp?t=1750924996\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/9bd63aa12bf57f2617bdeb7c36747b1e.webp?t=1750924996\" class=\"bb_img\" width=601 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever felt wonder gazing at a \u26c5 <strong>cloudy sky</strong>, or that cozy feeling watching a \u26c8\ufe0f <strong>storm</strong> from inside? These sensations inspired <i><strong>Cloudscrapers</strong></i>. The game is perfect for anyone who enjoys thoughtful gameplay without a large time commitment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with basic tools and construct the <strong>highest</strong>\u00a0<strong>tower</strong> possible. Each attempt takes around 15-30 minutes and helps you unlock <strong>upgrades</strong> to build even higher. Discover ancient mysteries hidden in the clouds - though some might be better left untouched.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>bite-sized strategy experience</strong>\u00a0- perfect for short gaming sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick-up-and-play simplicity</strong> with a pleasant amount of depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No complex menus or systems</strong>\u00a0- just intuitive building mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful progression</strong> with rewards that matter - no grinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric visuals</strong> and a <strong>mysterious narrative</strong> that unfolds as you reach new heights</p></li></ul>",
